> h0(a: u8, b: u8) = a+b
> h1(a: u8, b: u8) = b+a
> h2(a: u8, b: u8) = (a)+(b)
> h3(a: u8, b: u8) = 0+a+b
> equiv h0 h1
h0 and h1 are equal on the domain of h0 (exhaustive)
> equiv h1 h2
h1 and h2 are equal on the domain of h1 (exhaustive)
> equiv h2 h3
h2 and h3 are equal on the domain of h2 (exhaustive)
> equiv h0 h3
h0 and h3 are equal on the domain of h0 (exhaustive)
